<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Almost all Helibor rates were</p>
<p>lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The</p>
<p>3-month Helibor rate was down one basis point at 3.07</p>
<p>					  January 13 fix	 Jan 10 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			   3.01 pct	    3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			   3.03 pct	    3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			   3.07 pct	    3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			   3.15 pct	    3.17 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			   3.23 pct	    3.25 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			  3.32 pct	    3.34 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
